ey=missing status=accepted\",\n        \"corpus/tickets/TICKET-8729.md: every duplicate has request_class=bulk-refund and no idempotency key\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"finding\": \"Duplicate refunds were issued to three enterprise accounts\",\n      \"confidence\": \"high\",\n      \"evidence\": [\n        \"corpus/tickets/TICKET-8721.md: duplicate refunds observed for three enterprise accounts\",\n        \"corpus/timeline/incident_timeline.md: duplicate refunds reported\"\n      ]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"unresolved_ambiguity\": \"Initial theory (TICKET-8721) suggested worker replay investigation, but API gateway logs indicate the root cause was the guardrail bypass, not worker replay\"\n}\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
